1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,435
Ravan ne Ram ki maa ko samundar mein qaid kiya?

2
00:00:03,435 --> 00:00:05,840
Woh bhi Ram ke janm se pehle.

3
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:08,932
Yeh katha har taraf phones par ghoom rahi hai.

4
00:00:08,932 --> 00:00:10,650
Lekin yeh likhi kahan hai?

5
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:12,024
Jawab chaunkane wala hai.

6
00:00:12,024 --> 00:00:15,458
Yeh katha sach mein Sanskrit ke granth mein likhi hai.

7
00:00:15,458 --> 00:00:17,176
Uska naam hai Ananda Ramayan.

8
00:00:17,176 --> 00:00:19,580
Lekin woh Valmiki ki Ramayan nahi hai.

9
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,513
To phir sawaal uthta hai.

10
00:00:21,513 --> 00:00:24,219
Valmiki mein yeh katha kyun nahi milti?

11
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:28,471
Aur Ananda Ramayan likhi kab gayi? Iska jawab aapko hairaan karega,

12
00:00:28,471 --> 00:00:30,790
kyunki tareekh bahut baad ki hai.

13
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:34,839
Chaliye, sabut ke saath chalte hain. Viral katha se shuru karenge,

14
00:00:34,839 --> 00:00:38,152
phir Sanskrit granth, phir mitti ke neeche ke sabut.

15
00:00:38,152 --> 00:00:40,360
Har kadam par label saaf rahega.

16
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:44,616
Lekin pehle samajhiye, yeh katha itni pakad kyun rahi hai.

17
00:00:44,616 --> 00:00:48,871
Kyunki isme Ravan ka darr hai, Brahma ki bhavishyavani hai,

18
00:00:48,871 --> 00:00:51,850
aur samundar ke beech chhupa dibba hai.

19
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:53,107
Shuruaat granth se.

20
00:00:53,107 --> 00:00:57,296
Ananda Ramayan ke Sara Kanda mein yeh katha aati hai.

21
00:00:57,296 --> 00:01:01,485
Kanda yaani granth ka bada hissa, jaise kitab ka adhyay.

22
00:01:01,485 --> 00:01:03,580
Ab suniye kya likha hai.

23
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:06,310
Katha mein Ravan Brahma se poochhta hai,

24
00:01:06,310 --> 00:01:10,210
meri maut kiske haath hogi? Brahma ka jawab seedha hai.

25
00:01:10,210 --> 00:01:14,110
Kaushalya aur Dasharath ka beta tumhari maut ka kaaran banega.

26
00:01:14,110 --> 00:01:18,325
Socho, Ravan jaisa raja, aur usse darr lag raha hai. Kisse?

27
00:01:18,325 --> 00:01:21,774
Aise bachche se, jo abhi paida bhi nahi hua.

28
00:01:21,774 --> 00:01:24,840
Yahi darr poori katha ko aage dhakelta hai.

29
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:28,586
Granth kehta hai, Kaushalya ki shaadi hone hi wali thi.

30
00:01:28,586 --> 00:01:30,834
Theek usse pehle Ravan aata hai,

31
00:01:30,834 --> 00:01:34,581
aur rajkumari ko utha le jaata hai. Shaadi se pehle,

32
00:01:34,581 --> 00:01:35,330
dhyaan dijiye.

33
00:01:35,330 --> 00:01:36,993
Phir Ravan use maarta nahi.

34
00:01:36,993 --> 00:01:40,320
Woh Kaushalya ko lakdi ke dibbe mein band karta hai.

35
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,980
Aur dibba rakh deta hai samundar ke beech, sunsaan dweep par.

36
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:48,032
Dweep yaani paani se ghira zameen ka tukda. Na koi raasta,

37
00:01:48,032 --> 00:01:51,716
na koi naav. Ravan sochta hai, shaadi hi nahi hogi,

38
00:01:51,716 --> 00:01:53,190
to beta kaise hoga?

39
00:01:53,190 --> 00:01:58,187
Lekin yahan twist hai. Raja Dasharath samundar ke raste nikalte hain.

40
00:01:58,187 --> 00:02:01,820
Raaste mein Ravan ghaat lagakar hamla karta hai.

41
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:05,000
Ghaat lagana yaani chhup kar achanak waar.

42
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,602
Dasharath bach jaate hain.

43
00:02:06,602 --> 00:02:10,606
Lehron ke saath woh usi sunsaan dweep tak pahunchte hain.

44
00:02:10,606 --> 00:02:14,610
Aur wahan unhe milta hai, wahi lakdi ka band dibba.

45
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:18,944
Dibba khulta hai, andar Kaushalya hain. Aur granth kehta hai,

46
00:02:18,944 --> 00:02:23,279
unka Gandharva vivah dibbe ke andar hi ho jaata hai.

47
00:02:23,279 --> 00:02:27,180
Gandharva vivah yaani aapsi sahmati ki shaadi, bina baraat.

48
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:31,144
Socho, Ravan ne jis shaadi ko rokne ke liye sab kiya,

49
00:02:31,144 --> 00:02:33,667
wahi shaadi uske banaye dibbe mein hui.

50
00:02:33,667 --> 00:02:36,910
Kahani ka yahi palatvaar logon ko pakad leta hai.

51
00:02:36,910 --> 00:02:39,381
Kahani zabardast hai, isme koi shak nahi.

52
00:02:39,381 --> 00:02:41,851
Par asli sawaal ab shuru hota hai.

53
00:02:41,851 --> 00:02:43,616
Yeh Ananda Ramayan hai kya,

54
00:02:43,616 --> 00:02:46,440
aur Valmiki ki Ramayan mein yeh kyun nahi?

55
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:48,647
Ab chaliye us Ramayan ki taraf,

56
00:02:48,647 --> 00:02:51,589
jo Valmiki ke naam se jaani jaati hai.

57
00:02:51,589 --> 00:02:54,163
Hum Bala Kanda aur Uttara Kanda kholenge,

58
00:02:54,163 --> 00:02:56,370
kyunki suraag inhi mein hona chahiye.

59
00:02:56,370 --> 00:03:00,316
Bala Kanda yaani Ram ke janm aur bachpan wala hissa.

60
00:03:00,316 --> 00:03:02,684
Agar Kaushalya ka apaharan hua hota,

61
00:03:02,684 --> 00:03:05,052
to sabse sahi jagah yahi hoti.

62
00:03:05,052 --> 00:03:07,420
Apaharan yaani zabardasti utha le jaana.

63
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:08,782
Lekin scholars kehte hain,

64
00:03:08,782 --> 00:03:12,867
Valmiki ki purani Ramayan mein yeh dibbe wali katha milti hi nahi.

65
00:03:12,867 --> 00:03:15,590
Na Ravan ka hamla, na samundar ka dweep.

66
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:18,427
Bala Kanda mein Dasharath pehle se raja hain,

67
00:03:18,427 --> 00:03:21,974
aur Kaushalya unki rani. Santan ke liye yagya hota hai,

68
00:03:21,974 --> 00:03:25,520
phir Ram ka janm. Beech mein koi samundari kidnapping nahi.

69
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:28,692
Ab Uttara Kanda. Yeh aakhri hissa hai,

70
00:03:28,692 --> 00:03:33,225
jahan Ravan ki apni kahani bhi aati hai. Uska janm,

71
00:03:33,225 --> 00:03:38,210
uski tapasya, uske vardaan. Yahan to suraag milna hi chahiye tha.

72
00:03:38,210 --> 00:03:42,271
Lekin yahan bhi Kaushalya ke dibbe ki katha nahi milti,

73
00:03:42,271 --> 00:03:46,331
scholars aisa batate hain. To yeh katha aayi kahan se?

74
00:03:46,331 --> 00:03:49,580
Jawab Ananda Ramayan ki tareekh mein chhupa hai.

75
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:53,677
Ram katha ke aur bhi roop hain. Adhyatma Ramayan hai,

76
00:03:53,677 --> 00:03:55,725
Kamban ki Tamil Ramayan hai.

77
00:03:55,725 --> 00:04:01,870
Hamare sabut yeh dibbe wala prasang saaf taur par sirf Ananda Ramayan mein dikhate hain.

78
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:04,508
To ab tak ki tasveer saaf hai.

79
00:04:04,508 --> 00:04:08,277
Viral katha ka asli ghar Ananda Ramayan hai, Valmiki nahi.

80
00:04:08,277 --> 00:04:12,800
Par Ananda Ramayan ko bhi to log Valmiki ki hi maante hain?

81
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:17,524
Ab sabse bada sawaal. Ananda Ramayan likhi kisne, aur kab?

82
00:04:17,524 --> 00:04:21,776
Yahan parampara aur itihaaskar alag alag jawab dete hain.

83
00:04:21,776 --> 00:04:24,610
Parampara yaani pidhiyon se chali maanyata.

84
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:25,686
Parampara kehti hai,

85
00:04:25,686 --> 00:04:28,916
Ananda Ramayan bhi rishi Valmiki ki hi rachna hai.

86
00:04:28,916 --> 00:04:32,145
Isiliye kai bhakt ise utna hi pavitra maante hain,

87
00:04:32,145 --> 00:04:33,580
jitna Valmiki Ramayan ko.

88
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:37,445
Ab itihaaskaron ki taraf. Text ke itihaaskar yaani woh log,

89
00:04:37,445 --> 00:04:41,697
jo granth ki bhasha aur shaili se uski umar naapte hain.

90
00:04:41,697 --> 00:04:43,630
Unki raay bilkul alag hai.

91
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:45,839
Zyaadatar modern scholars kehte hain,

92
00:04:45,839 --> 00:04:49,373
Ananda Ramayan 15th century CE mein likhi gayi,

93
00:04:49,373 --> 00:04:54,233
yaani 1500 tak ke daur mein. Yeh madhyakaal ka granth hai,

94
00:04:54,233 --> 00:04:56,000
madhyakaal yaani medieval daur.

95
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,112
Matlab saaf hai.

96
00:04:57,112 --> 00:05:00,820
Scholars ke hisaab se yeh Valmiki ki original rachna nahi,

97
00:05:00,820 --> 00:05:03,415
balki baad mein likhi gayi kriti hai.

98
00:05:03,415 --> 00:05:06,010
Aur wahi dibbe wali katha sunati hai.

99
00:05:06,010 --> 00:05:09,343
Phir yeh granth likha kyun gaya? Scholars kehte hain,

100
00:05:09,343 --> 00:05:11,565
iski khaas baat nayi kahaniyan hain.

101
00:05:11,565 --> 00:05:16,380
Aisi kahaniyan jo Valmiki Ramayan ki kahani ko peeche ka background deti hain.

102
00:05:16,380 --> 00:05:18,542
Jaise film ka prequel hota hai.

103
00:05:18,542 --> 00:05:20,704
Main kahani pehle se pata hai,

104
00:05:20,704 --> 00:05:23,587
prequel batata hai ki usse pehle kya hua.

105
00:05:23,587 --> 00:05:26,470
Kaushalya ka dibba waisa hi prequel lagta hai.

106
00:05:26,470 --> 00:05:28,643
Lekin bhakton ka sawaal bhi waajib hai.

107
00:05:28,643 --> 00:05:30,505
Kya yeh kahaniyan bilkul nayi thi,

108
00:05:30,505 --> 00:05:33,608
ya pehle se logon ki zubaan par chal rahi thi,

109
00:05:33,608 --> 00:05:35,160
aur baad mein likhi gayi?

110
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:38,103
Yahi asli bahas hai. Kuch kehte hain,

111
00:05:38,103 --> 00:05:41,465
yeh purani maukhik parampara hai, maukhik yaani zubaani,

112
00:05:41,465 --> 00:05:44,408
jo sirf sunai gayi. Baaki kehte hain,

113
00:05:44,408 --> 00:05:46,930
yeh baad ki rachnatmak kalpana hai.

114
00:05:46,930 --> 00:05:50,215
Kaun sahi hai, yeh tay karna hamara kaam nahi.

115
00:05:50,215 --> 00:05:54,230
Hum sirf sabut rakhte hain. Par is katha ki banawat mein,

116
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:56,420
aur bhi bada suraag chhupa hai.

117
00:05:56,420 --> 00:05:59,870
Ab zara dhyaan se suniye. Raja ko bhavishyavani milti hai,

118
00:05:59,870 --> 00:06:02,285
ki aane wala bachcha uski maut banega.

119
00:06:02,285 --> 00:06:05,390
Kya yeh kahani aapne pehle kahin aur suni hai?

120
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:08,825
Haan, Bhagavata Purana mein. Wahan Kamsa ko pata chalta hai,

121
00:06:08,825 --> 00:06:11,229
ki Devaki ka beta uska ant karega.

122
00:06:11,229 --> 00:06:14,320
Aur Kamsa Devaki ko qaid mein daal deta hai.

123
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:17,879
Ab kahaniyan aamne saamne rakhiye. Darra hua raja, bhavishyavani,

124
00:06:17,879 --> 00:06:22,228
aur hone wali maa ki qaid. Dhaancha bilkul milta julta hai,

125
00:06:22,228 --> 00:06:23,810
sirf naam badle hain.

126
00:06:23,810 --> 00:06:27,599
Folklorists yaani lok kathaon ke jaankaar, ise motif kehte hain.

127
00:06:27,599 --> 00:06:29,873
Motif yaani kahani ka aisa saancha,

128
00:06:29,873 --> 00:06:32,904
jo katha se katha mein safar karta hai,

129
00:06:32,904 --> 00:06:34,420
jaise gaane ki dhun.

130
00:06:34,420 --> 00:06:37,810
Unki raay hai, Kaushalya ke apaharan wala saancha,

131
00:06:37,810 --> 00:06:42,048
Kamsa aur Devaki ki kahani se prerit ho sakta hai.

132
00:06:42,048 --> 00:06:44,590
Prerit yaani usse inspiration lekar bana.

133
00:06:44,590 --> 00:06:48,783
Lekin yeh bhi samajhiye, kahaniyon ka aise milna koi apmaan nahi.

134
00:06:48,783 --> 00:06:52,595
Bharat mein kathayen hamesha aapas mein baat karti aayi hain,

135
00:06:52,595 --> 00:06:54,120
gaon se gaon tak.

136
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:56,090
Dadi naani bhi kahani sunate waqt,

137
00:06:56,090 --> 00:06:58,718
purani katha mein naya rang bhar deti thi.

138
00:06:58,718 --> 00:07:02,330
Shayad granthon ke likhne walon ne bhi kuch aisa hi kiya.

139
00:07:02,330 --> 00:07:05,122
Par granth to kaagaz ki baat hai.

140
00:07:05,122 --> 00:07:07,516
Asli sawaal ab shuru hota hai.

141
00:07:07,516 --> 00:07:09,909
Kya zameen ke neeche se bhi,

142
00:07:09,909 --> 00:07:13,100
Kaushalya ke Kosala ka koi sabut milta hai?

143
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:16,161
Ab granth band, aur kudaal haath mein.

144
00:07:16,161 --> 00:07:18,348
Kudaal yaani khudai ka auzaar.

145
00:07:18,348 --> 00:07:23,595
Archaeology yaani zameen khod kar purane logon ke nishaan dhoondhne ka vigyan.

146
00:07:23,595 --> 00:07:24,470
Chaliye Ayodhya.

147
00:07:24,470 --> 00:07:26,232
1975 ke season mein,

148
00:07:26,232 --> 00:07:30,195
Archaeology of Ramayana Sites naam ka project Ayodhya pahuncha.

149
00:07:30,195 --> 00:07:31,516
Maqsad seedha tha.

150
00:07:31,516 --> 00:07:35,920
Ramayan se jude sthanon ki mitti mein kya chhupa hai?

151
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:39,172
Yeh kaam ASI ke project ke tahat hua.

152
00:07:39,172 --> 00:07:43,238
ASI yaani Archaeological Survey of India, desh ki puraatattva sanstha.

153
00:07:43,238 --> 00:07:46,490
Unhone zameen ki parat dar parat khudai ki.

154
00:07:46,490 --> 00:07:49,674
Parat yaani layer. Jaise cake ki tahein hoti hain,

155
00:07:49,674 --> 00:07:51,089
neeche wali sabse purani.

156
00:07:51,089 --> 00:07:54,980
Zameen bhi waise hi sadiyon ki tahein jod kar banti hai.

157
00:07:54,980 --> 00:07:58,776
Aur sabse neeche kya mila? Lagaataar insaani basti ke nishaan,

158
00:07:58,776 --> 00:08:01,434
jo 7th century BCE tak jaate hain.

159
00:08:01,434 --> 00:08:05,230
BCE yaani Isa Masih ke janm se pehle ka samay.

160
00:08:05,230 --> 00:08:09,037
Basti yaani log yahan rehte the, ghar banate the,

161
00:08:09,037 --> 00:08:11,153
roz ki zindagi jeete the.

162
00:08:11,153 --> 00:08:14,960
Mitti ki tahein unke rehne ki gawahi deti hain.

163
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:18,667
Lekin dhyaan dijiye. Khudai batati hai ki purani basti thi.

164
00:08:18,667 --> 00:08:22,746
Woh yeh nahi batati ki Kaushalya kisi dibbe mein band thi.

165
00:08:22,746 --> 00:08:24,970
Mitti katha ko sabit nahi karti.

166
00:08:24,970 --> 00:08:27,741
Aur na hi woh use jhuthlati hai.

167
00:08:27,741 --> 00:08:31,305
Katha aur khudai alag sawaalon ke jawab dete hain.

168
00:08:31,305 --> 00:08:35,660
Par Kosala ki kahani sirf Ayodhya tak simit nahi. Aage chaliye.

169
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:37,979
Ab Shravasti, Kosala ki purani rajdhani.

170
00:08:37,979 --> 00:08:40,685
Ramayan mein Kosala ke raja Dasharath hain.

171
00:08:40,685 --> 00:08:44,164
Kosala yaani Ayodhya ke aas paas ka bada rajya,

172
00:08:44,164 --> 00:08:46,870
jo aaj ke Uttar Pradesh mein tha.

173
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:49,603
Yahan ASI ki khudai mein kilebandi mili.

174
00:08:49,603 --> 00:08:53,117
Kilebandi yaani shahar ko bachane wali deewar aur ghera.

175
00:08:53,117 --> 00:08:56,240
Saath mein shahri basti ki tahein bhi mili.

176
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:59,709
Yeh tahein 6th century BCE se shuru hoti hain.

177
00:08:59,709 --> 00:09:02,021
Yaani Kosala mein shahar ki zindagi,

178
00:09:02,021 --> 00:09:05,490
Isa se kai sadiyan pehle phal phool rahi thi.

179
00:09:05,490 --> 00:09:09,597
To mitti kya kehti hai? Kosala mein purane shahar the,

180
00:09:09,597 --> 00:09:14,116
log the, deewarein thi. Lekin samundar ke dweep par rakha dibba,

181
00:09:14,116 --> 00:09:16,580
iska koi khudai wala sabut nahi.

182
00:09:16,580 --> 00:09:17,732
Aur sach kahein,

183
00:09:17,732 --> 00:09:21,573
kisi katha ke liye aisa sabut milna mushkil hi hai.

184
00:09:21,573 --> 00:09:25,030
Lakdi ka dibba lehron mein sadiyon tak kaise bachta?

185
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:26,950
Par sawaal abhi baaki hai.

186
00:09:26,950 --> 00:09:30,510
Ab woh hissa jo koi viral clip nahi batata.

187
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:34,862
Kya abhi tak pata hi nahi chala? Jawab hai, kaafi kuch.

188
00:09:34,862 --> 00:09:36,840
Aur yahi sabse dilchasp hai.

189
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:41,515
Sabse bada raaz yeh hai. Sanskrit mein likhe jaane se pehle,

190
00:09:41,515 --> 00:09:45,340
yeh dibbe wali katha kahan janmi? Kis ilaake mein,

191
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:47,890
kis bhasha mein, kiski zubaan par?

192
00:09:47,890 --> 00:09:52,418
Ho sakta hai yeh kisi kshetriya bhasha ki lok katha rahi ho.

193
00:09:52,418 --> 00:09:55,813
Kshetriya yaani kisi ilaake ki apni bhasha. Par kaunsi,

194
00:09:55,813 --> 00:09:57,700
yeh abhi koi nahi jaanta.

195
00:09:57,700 --> 00:10:01,187
Agla raaz, Ananda Ramayan ka asli lekhak kaun?

196
00:10:01,187 --> 00:10:02,931
Parampara Valmiki kehti hai,

197
00:10:02,931 --> 00:10:06,854
scholars baad ke kisi lekhak ki baat karte hain.

198
00:10:06,854 --> 00:10:09,470
Pakki pehchaan abhi tak dhundhli hai.

199
00:10:09,470 --> 00:10:11,457
Aakhri sawaal sabse gehra hai.

200
00:10:11,457 --> 00:10:16,224
Kya yeh kahani kisi purani zubaani parampara ki bachi hui goonj hai?

201
00:10:16,224 --> 00:10:19,800
Ya kavi ki apni kalpana? Bahas abhi khuli hai.

202
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:22,233
To ab aapke paas poori tasveer hai.

203
00:10:22,233 --> 00:10:25,362
Katha Ananda Ramayan mein hai. Valmiki mein nahi milti.

204
00:10:25,362 --> 00:10:28,490
Aur uski jad abhi bhi dhoondhi ja rahi hai.

205
00:10:28,490 --> 00:10:32,470
Agar aap yeh duniya khud dekhna chahte hain, to Ayodhya jaiye.

206
00:10:32,470 --> 00:10:35,364
Saryu ke ghaat par shaam ki aarti dekhiye.

207
00:10:35,364 --> 00:10:38,620
Wahi nadi jiska zikr Ramayan baar baar karti hai.

208
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:39,874
Phir Shravasti jaiye.

209
00:10:39,874 --> 00:10:43,636
Wahan khule mein purane teele aur khandahar dikhte hain.

210
00:10:43,636 --> 00:10:45,726
Teela yaani mitti ka ubhaar,

211
00:10:45,726 --> 00:10:49,070
jiske neeche sadiyon purani basti dabi hoti hai.

212
00:10:49,070 --> 00:10:50,592
Aur granth padhna ho,

213
00:10:50,592 --> 00:10:55,156
to Valmiki Ramayan ka Bala Kanda aur Ananda Ramayan ka Sara Kanda,

214
00:10:55,156 --> 00:10:58,960
aamne saamne rakh kar padhiye. Fark aap khud pakad lenge.

215
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:01,203
Aur ghar mein dadi naani se poochhiye.

216
00:11:01,203 --> 00:11:04,407
Unhone yeh dibbe wali katha kahan suni thi? Kya pata,

217
00:11:04,407 --> 00:11:07,290
unki yaad mein koi purana kshetriya roop chhupa ho.

218
00:11:07,290 --> 00:11:10,228
To wapas wahin, jahan se shuru kiya tha.

219
00:11:10,228 --> 00:11:14,268
Kya Ravan ne Ram ki maa ko samundar mein qaid kiya?

220
00:11:14,268 --> 00:11:17,940
Ananda Ramayan haan kehti hai. Valmiki is par chup hai.

221
00:11:17,940 --> 00:11:21,143
Scholars ise 15th century ki rachna maante hain,

222
00:11:21,143 --> 00:11:23,946
Kamsa ki kahani ki goonj ke saath.

223
00:11:23,946 --> 00:11:28,350
Parampara ise Valmiki ki den maanti hai. Faisla aapki samajh par.

224
00:11:28,350 --> 00:11:31,396
Agla safar samundar ka. Ram Setu,

225
00:11:31,396 --> 00:11:35,964
jiska ISRO ke satellite naksha ne 29 km lamba,

226
00:11:35,964 --> 00:11:41,040
paani ke neeche chattani silsila dikhaya. Lekin woh bana kaise?

227
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:45,578
Geological Survey of India ise lehron se bani kudrati banawat maanta hai.

228
00:11:45,578 --> 00:11:48,981
Kuch log ise insaani haath ka kaam kehte hain.

229
00:11:48,981 --> 00:11:51,250
Sach kya hai? Agle video mein.

230
00:11:51,250 --> 00:11:54,150
Aur ab aapse sawaal.

231
00:11:54,150 --> 00:12:01,399
Aapne yeh dibbe wali katha sabse pehle kahan suni thi,

232
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:08,648
dadi naani se ya phone par? Comments mein zaroor batayiye.
